from pathlib import Path
import json
privacy={
'EFFECTIVE_DATE':'21 November 2026',
'OPERATOR_AND_CONTACT':'ITCChase is a project operated by Sayed Zahur. For support and privacy requests, use the contact page. The Contact form stores your email and message privately for operator review; never include invoice files, GSTINs, session cookies or other private business information. Support requests are retained for 30 days and removed on subsequent submissions; operator replies are manual. You can delete stored reports directly from your Overview page without contacting support.',
'DATA_AND_PURPOSES':'When you run a reconciliation, we process supplier names and GSTINs, invoice numbers, dates, taxable values and tax components from the two files you select. This data is used to compare invoices, group differences and generate supplier follow-up drafts. File contents are processed in server memory and raw uploaded files are not saved. Normalized invoice data and report results are stored to display your monthly overview. Synthetic demo data does not represent actual traders or transactions.',
'COOKIES_AND_ANALYTICS':'An essential HttpOnly, SameSite session cookie gives this browser access to its reports for up to 30 days. It is a bearer credential, not a verified identity or firm account. Do not share your browser session. Clearing cookies removes your access but does not immediately erase stored reports. The shared analytics component is disabled: no analytics cookies, marketing trackers or third-party analytics scripts are enabled. We record a count of successfully completed live reconciliations without invoice details in a separate event table. Demo runs do not contribute to this count.',
'PROCESSORS_AND_TRANSFERS':'Vercel serves the application and processes upload requests. Neon Postgres stores normalized reports in the project region recorded in DECISIONS.md. Provider systems may process network and operational metadata in other locations. Rate limiting uses a one-way hash of the hosting platform-provided network address and session identifiers. Opening WhatsApp or an email draft transfers the selected draft to your chosen communication provider only when you activate that link. Review recipient and content before sending; ITCChase does not send messages automatically.',
'RETENTION_AND_SECURITY':'Reports become inaccessible after 30 days and expired records are deleted during the next successful live reconciliation. This means physical deletion can occur later than 30 days when the service is idle; provider backups may persist according to provider policies. You can immediately delete active reports belonging to your session using Delete my reports in Overview. Event counts are retained for up to 90 days, with cleanup on subsequent runs. Rate-limit records are cleaned after two hours on subsequent runs. Uploads are limited to 2 MB and 5,000 rows per file. Transport encryption, parameterized database queries and session ownership checks reduce risk, but no system can guarantee absolute security.',
'RIGHTS_AND_REQUESTS':'Upload only records you are authorized to process. You may stop using the service, delete your reports, or request assistance through Contact. No account recovery exists in this early preview: if you clear the cookie, wait for expiry or contact support without sharing financial data. We do not sell business data or use it for advertising. Applicable privacy rights depend on your location; we will consider legitimate requests and explain any limitations before requesting further information.',
'POLICY_CHANGES':'This policy reflects the current preview. Changes to retention, payment processing or analytics will be described here before those features are activated. The effective date above identifies this version. Review it when uploading new records.'}
terms={
'EFFECTIVE_DATE':'21 November 2026',
'SERVICE_AND_ACCEPTANCE':'ITCChase compares a purchase register with an uploaded GSTR-2B table and prepares supplier follow-up drafts. By using it, you agree to these terms and the Privacy policy. The preview supports one business per browser workspace. It does not file returns, connect to GSTN, verify supplier filing or determine statutory eligibility for input tax credit. Amounts labeled at risk indicate tax on invoices that require review, not tax legally lost or recoverable.',
'ELIGIBILITY_AND_ACCOUNTS':'Use the service only if you are authorized to process the uploaded business records and are legally able to accept these terms. Access is tied to an essential browser session cookie, not an email account. Reports are available only in that session and may become inaccessible if cookies are cleared. There is no multi-client agency management or account recovery in this preview. Keep the device and session secure and avoid shared computers for financial data.',
'ACCEPTABLE_USE':'Do not upload records without permission, malware, macro-enabled workbooks or formula-bearing spreadsheets. Do not attempt to access another session, bypass upload limits, overwhelm the service or use supplier drafts for unsolicited bulk messaging. Supported files contain one normalized invoice per row, positive amounts and the specified columns. Credit notes, amendments, reverse charge and eligibility classifications require separate professional review. Do not rely on this tool as your only accounting record.',
'CONTENT_AND_IP':'You retain your rights in uploaded business records. You authorize processing and temporary storage solely to provide the reconciliation and related support described in the privacy policy. Synthetic demo content is labeled as such. Source-code licensing is described in the repository; third-party libraries retain their own licenses. No endorsement by GSTN, a tax authority or an accounting professional is claimed.',
'PAYMENT_AND_CANCELLATION':'The first reconciliation is free. During this early pilot, access remains free and no payment details are collected. The intended ongoing subscription price is ₹499 per month, but paid subscriptions are not currently available. No automatic renewal, debit, cancellation fee or payment commitment is created by trying the preview. Applicable taxes, billing terms, cancellation and refund conditions will be disclosed before any future purchase; pricing is subject to confirmation when checkout launches.',
'LIABILITY_AND_DISPUTES':'Reconciliation depends on the completeness and accuracy of both uploaded files. Matching uses GSTIN and invoice number, a two-day date tolerance and one-rupee component tolerance. Review every discrepancy and message before relying on or sending it. Consult your tax adviser for tax decisions and statutory deadlines. Service availability and uninterrupted access are not guaranteed. To the extent permitted by applicable law, the operator does not accept liability for decisions based solely on automated results. Nothing excludes rights or liabilities that cannot lawfully be excluded. Contact the operator first to seek a practical resolution of disputes; applicable law governs.',
'TERMINATION_AND_CHANGES':'You may stop using ITCChase at any time and delete session reports from Overview. Access may be restricted for abuse, security incidents or maintenance. Reports expire after 30 days as described in the privacy policy; retain your original records independently. Material service changes will be described on the site. Continued use after an updated effective date is subject to the updated terms, without overriding rights required by law.',
'OPERATOR_AND_CONTACT':'The project operator is Sayed Zahur. Use the Contact page for support, questions about these terms or privacy assistance. The support form is private: do not include financial records, credentials or session cookies. For immediate deletion of your current session’s reports, use Delete my reports on Overview.'}
for slug,template,values in [('privacy','privacy-policy.md',privacy),('terms','terms.md',terms)]:
 text=Path('../launch-kit/templates/'+template).read_text()
 for k,v in values.items(): text=text.replace('{{'+k+'}}',v)
 Path('docs/'+template).write_text(text)
 lines=text.strip().split('\n\n');title=lines.pop(0)[2:];html=''
 for part in lines:
  if part.startswith('## '): html+='<h2>'+part[3:]+'</h2>'
  else: html+='<p>'+part+'</p>'
 Path('app/'+slug+'/page.tsx').write_text("import Link from 'next/link';\nexport default function Page(){return <article className=\"wrap prose\"><div className=\"eyebrow\">ITCChase · Policies</div><h1>"+title+'</h1>'+html+'<p><Link href="/contact">Contact and support</Link> · <Link href="/dashboard">Manage your reports</Link></p></article>;}\n')
